// Two-storey office block: a lobby with the stairs at the front, a corridor across the middle,
// offices round it, restrooms on both floors, and upstairs a meeting room, a break room, a copy
// room and a store room. One character per tile; "." is outside. The bottom row is the front of
// the building and faces the street. Openings are (x, y, side): side N/E/S/W of tile (x, y).
